# What the speech role loads, and where each file comes from (ADR-0059).
#
# One file per line: its SHA-256, its path under the models volume, and its source. The set is
# fetched by deploy/compose/speech-models.sh, which refuses any file whose digest differs. A
# model or a voice is changed here, in review, and nowhere else.
#
# Whisper models (whisper.cpp ggml format). large-v3-turbo is the GPU default; small.en is the
# processor fallback. The VAD model lets the server skip silence instead of inventing text.
1fc70f774d38eb169993ac391eea357ef47c88757ef72ee5943879b7e8e2bc69  ggml-large-v3-turbo.bin  https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp/resolve/main/ggml-large-v3-turbo.bin
c6138d6d58ecc8322097e0f987c32f1be8bb0a18532a3f88f734d1bbf9c41e5d  ggml-small.en.bin  https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp/resolve/main/ggml-small.en.bin
29940d98d42b91fbd05ce489f3ecf7c72f0a42f027e4875919a28fb4c04ea2cf  ggml-silero-v5.1.2.bin  https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/whisper-vad/resolve/main/ggml-silero-v5.1.2.bin
